d demanded adjudication, repeating it with stronger evidence is the protocol-faithful move. I'll go with A.\n\nBut to add value, maybe I can make the conflict disappear *legitimately* by... hmm, one thing: what if the AC-004 test's premise could be satisfied by there being a shard declaring AC-009 planned... no, the assertion is on AC-006.\n\nOK, A it is. impl.md updated. Let me verify impl.md renders fine and double check nothing else was modified accidentally (e.g., check I didn't create files in repo). I wrote 21 temp .sh files to os.tmpdir — outside repo, fine, but let me clean them up.\n\nAlso verify no repo files changed besides impl.md: cannot use git. Use a quick heuristic: check mtimes? I've only edited impl.md and written temp files outside. Fine.\n\nCleanup temp probes.","signature":""}],"model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":null,"cache_read_input_tokens":null,"cache_creation":null,"server_tool_use":null,"service_tier":null}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"_requestId":"01a1b71e589b739baef1abfd7ed1bb22","_messageId":"01a1b7204ea978f2aea2e522354bdc00","_meta":{"codebuddy.ai/conversationRequestId":"01a1b71e589b739baef1abfd7ed1bb22","codebuddy.ai/modelRequestId":"01a1b7204ea978f2aea2e522354bdc00","codebuddy.ai/llmMessageId":"01a1b7204ea978f2aea2e522354bdc00","codebuddy.ai/messageId":"01a1b720-4ea9-78f2-aea2-e524439b370f","traceparent":"00-9b0fe01e2731504db3f9001fe864fef9-0ececfaf9ae41c88-01","baggage":"codebuddy.session_id=01a1b71e-525f-7f87-9dac-5d469b1f7ff6,codebuddy.conversation_request_id=01a1b71e589b739baef1abfd7ed1bb22"},"__timestamp":"2026-11-07T17:48:36.581Z"}
